<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman starts AECI coverage.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman starts AECI coverage.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs began coverage of South African chemicals group AECI Ltd with a &quot;market outperformer&quot; rating, the investment bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Further detail was not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
